            "profile_photo_url" : "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXDdABxITKr7ryffzrPLkkwufUe_TqPX8JUGSpyZ8xkNLesVvANqQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
            "rating" : 1,
            "relative_time_description" : "3 years ago",
            "text" : "I had my wisdom teeth as well as a tooth extracted by Dr Richardson a couple years ago. I woke up during the surgery feeling all of the pain of my teeth being extracted because the anesthesia was not properly monitored. I also had purple marks all around the roof of my mouth and gums because the suction was left on my gums for too long resulting in pain and bruising for weeks after the surgery. I remember the surgery and pain as I was awake for the majority of it with a cloth over my eyes preventing the doctors from checking that I was awake.This was a very traumatic experience and I would not recommend this practice to anyone.",
            "time" : 1669233370,
            "translated" : false
